===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|lang=fr|taximètre}}, from {{etyl|de|en}} {{term|lang=de|Taxameter}}, coined from Medieval {{etyl|la|-}} {{term|lang=la|taxa|gloss=tax, charge}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|-}} base {{term|lang=ine-pro|*tag-|gloss=to touch, to handle}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[device]] installed in a [[taxicab]] that [[calculate]]s the [[fare]] based upon [[distance]] [[travelled]] and [[waiting]] [[time]].

